controls.description:
Mechanisms exist to maintain a dynamically updated inventory of Technology Assets, Applications, Services and/or Data (TAASD) that provides a highly contextualized understanding of every asset that is capable of providing operational visibility required to:
(1) Detect anomalies;
(2) Manage complex vulnerabilities;
(3) Maintain compliance; and
(4) Maintain resilient capabilities.

